# The lines above are root-anchored in Docker's matcher; repeat the secret/model patterns with a
# `**/` prefix so a nested `subdir/.env`, `subdir/keys/private.pem` or `subdir/models/` cannot
# enter the build context either.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/models
**/model
**/*.pkl
market_sentiment_tool/dist
market_sentiment_tool/backend/chroma_db
market_sentiment_tool/backend/*.sqlite3*
